 and national congressional debates in Washington D.C. with no specific connection to California politics or state/local governance.\\n---\\n\\n--- Target Article to Classify ---\\nTitle: Expected Title\\nBody: This is a very long article with lots of words and stopwords.\\n            The weather in California is beautiful today, Newsom says.\\n            This is a very long article with lots of words and stopwords.\\n            The weather in California is beautiful today, Newsom says.\\n\\nDetermine if the Target Article is RELEVANT or IRRELEVANT and provide your rationale.\", timestamp=datetime.datetime(2026, 7, 9, 19, 10, 32, 608521, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))], timestamp=datetime.datetime(2026, 7, 9, 19, 10, 32, 608704, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), instructions=\"You are a California Politics Relevance Classifier.\\nYour job is to determine whether a news article is relevant to California politics, policy, elections, lobbying, or state/local governance.\\n\\nTo help you, we have provided positive and negative examples of classification decisions with rationales.\\nExamine the title and body of the target article and classify it as either 'RELEVANT' or 'IRRELEVANT', along with a concise rationale.\", run_id='019f4849-ee9f-71be-8901-b4a5598d2583', conversation_id='019f4849-ee9f-71be-8901-b4a40dccced5')\n]", "stream": "False", "model_settings": "{}", "model_request_parameters": "ModelRequestParameters(function_tools=[], native_tools=[], output_mode='tool', output_tools=[ToolDefinition(name='final_result', parameters_json_schema={'properties': {'classification': {'description': 'Whether the article is RELEVANT or IRRELEVANT to California politics', 'enum': ['RELEVANT', 'IRRELEVANT'], 'type': 'string'}, 'rationale': {'description': 'A concise rationale/explanation for the classification decision', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['classification', 'rationale'], 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, description='The final response which ends this